Task 1 adapts behavior and selected implementation ideas from RefleK's, an
open-source KovaaK's analytics application distributed under GPL-3.0:
https://github.com/ARm8-2/refleks

Relevant upstream sources reviewed for this task include:
- internal/runs/kovaaks/stats.go
- internal/runs/kovaaks/performances.go
- internal/watcher/watcher.go

Aiming Cookie's Task 1 implementation is a Python reimplementation within the
existing Aiming Cookie architecture. It does not embed the RefleK's Wails/Go
runtime. Changes made here are identified in the implementation plan and
remain subject to the GPL-3.0 terms.
